{%- comment -%}
	Renders one "Instagram Followers" tile (image or video, optional link).
	Pulled out of sections/instagram-followers.liquid into its own snippet
	purely to keep that file under theme-check's LiquidComplexity limit —
	this block of per-block conditional logic was self-contained (only
	reads `block`) and pushed the section over 120.
	Expects: block (the "item" block being rendered), index0 (0-based
	position in section.blocks), total (section.blocks.size)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
	comment
		Vertical stagger, reverse-engineered from the reference site's own
		shipped CSS/JS: every tile is nudged straight down by 48px times its
		distance from the row's center tile — the center tile stays put
		(offset 0), tiles further from center sit progressively lower. With
		an odd tile count the center is a real tile (offset 0); with an even
		count "center" falls between two tiles and neither reaches offset 0 —
		same symmetric curve either way. Liquid has no built-in abs() for a
		possibly-negative float, so it's done by hand via the ternary-esque
		if/else below.
	endcomment
	assign center = total | minus: 1 | divided_by: 2.0
	assign distance = index0 | minus: center
	if distance < 0
		assign distance = distance | times: -1
	endif
	assign item_offset = distance | times: 48

	comment
		Mobile shows only a centered window of (up to) 3 tiles — for the
		reference site's fixed 5 tiles that's always tiles 2/3/4, but this
		section allows 1-5, so the window is computed rather than hardcoded:
		with 3 or fewer tiles configured, show all of them.
	endcomment
	assign hide_mobile = false
	if total > 3
		assign window_start = total | minus: 3 | divided_by: 2
		assign window_end = window_start | plus: 2
		if index0 < window_start or index0 > window_end
			assign hide_mobile = true
		endif
	endif
	assign item_classes = ''
	if hide_mobile
		assign item_classes = ' instagram-followers--item--hide-mobile'
	endif
-%}
<div class="instagram-followers--item{{ item_classes }}" style="--if-item-offset: {{ item_offset }}px;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
	<div class="instagram-followers--item-media">
		{%- if block.settings.media_type == 'video' and block.settings.video -%}
			{{ block.settings.video | video_tag: autoplay: true, loop: true, controls: false, muted: true, image_size: '750x' }}
		{%- elsif block.settings.media_type == 'image' and block.settings.image -%}
			{%- render 'responsive-image', image: block.settings.image, sizes: '187x0,375x0,562x0,750x0' -%}
		{%- else -%}
			<div class="thb-placeholder">
				{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder_svg_tag' }}
			</div>
		{%- endif -%}
		{%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}
			<a href="{{ block.settings.link }}" class="instagram-followers--item-link"{% if block.settings.image.alt != blank %} aria-label="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"{% endif %}{% if block.settings.link_new_tab %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}></a>
		{%- endif -%}
	</div>
</div>
